Subject: [PATCH 12/23] fix(remote): preserve blocking Windows bridge writes

Backport the transport correction from herdrdev/herdr commit b28e7709d963be5fb4472d3db69f349cf1468213. Keep the fork endpoint, session and provisioning contracts. Exercise large downloads through the polling reader and peer-disconnect cleanup on native Windows.

Refs herdrdev/herdr#3661 and herdrdev/herdr#3701

test(remote): prepare and clean the native bridge socket

Refs herdrdev/herdr#3701
---
 src/remote/attach.rs | 86 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 82 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

